    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T12:40:21Z",
    "body": "The current spec is\n\n> The tabIndex IDL attribute must [reflect](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#reflect) the value of the tabindex content attribute. Its default value is 0 for elements that are focusable and −1 for elements that are not focusable.\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#dom-tabindex\n\nCan you elaborate on what the issue is?\n",
